|}The two factions of the DP nominated Sodnomzunduin Erdene and MP [[Norovyn Altankhuyag]] as their presidential nominees. Altankhuyag was nominated by a 97.6% vote from National Policy Committee, and was backed by all 11 Democratic MPs.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Manlay |first=B. |date=2021-05-02 |title=АН-ын ҮБХ Н.Алтанхуягийг Ерөнхийлөгчийн сонгуульд нэр дэвшүүлэхийг 97.6%-ийн саналаар дэмжлээ |url=https://ikon.mn/n/27gx |access-date=2025-09-09 |website=Ikon |language=mn}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Nomin |first=G. |date=2021-05-01 |title=О.Цогтгэрэл даргатай АН-аас УИХ-ын гишүүн Н.Алтанхуягийг Ерөнхийлөгчийн сонгуульд нэр дэвшүүлэхээр болжээ |url=https://ikon.mn/n/27gg |access-date=2025-09-09 |website=Ikon |language=mn}}</ref> Erdene was nominated by the Tulgat-led faction on the day before Altankhuyag's nomination, [[Oyungerel Tsedevdamba|Tsedevdambyn Oyungerel]] had been considered a potential candidate<ref>{{Cite web |title=Is Mongolia Ready for a Female President? |url=https://thediplomat.com/2021/01/is-mongolia-ready-for-a-female-president/ |access-date=8 February 2021 |website=The Diplomat|language=en-US}}</ref> but she lost her bid to Erdene.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Nomin |first=G. |date=2021-05-01 |title=М.Тулгат даргатай АН-аас Ерөнхийлөгчийн сонгуульд өрсөлдөх нэр дэвшигчээр С.Эрдэнэ тодорчээ |url=https://ikon.mn/n/27gf |access-date=2025-09-09 |website=Ikon |language=mn}}</ref>

The [[General Election Commission of Mongolia|General Election Commission]] (GEC) did not accept the two candidates until the party fully decided on a single candidate on May 6.<ref>{{Cite web |title=БАРИМТ БИЧГИЙГ НЯГТЛАН ШАЛГАЖ ХҮЛЭЭН АВАХЫГ ҮҮРЭГ БОЛГОВ |url=https://www.gec.gov.mn/blog/3137 |access-date=2025-09-09 |website=General Election Committee |language=mn}}</ref> Altankhuyag's ally MPs and supporters protested the GEC decision to not accept the registration, stating "Erdene fractured our party and is not the representation of our party"<ref>{{Cite web |last=Saran |first=T.|date=2021-05-05 |title=УИХ дахь АН-ын бүлгийн гишүүд суулт зарлажээ |url=https://ikon.mn/n/27l7 |access-date=2025-09-09 |website=Ikon |language=mn}}</ref> and launched hunger strikes and demonstrations in [[Sükhbaatar Square]].<ref>{{Cite web |last=Saran |first=T. |date=2021-05-05 |title=ФОТО: Нэр дэвшигчээ бүртгэхийг шаардаж, өлсгөлөн зарлаж буй АН-ын гишүүд |url=https://ikon.mn/n/27lv |access-date=2025-09-09 |website=Ikon |language=mn}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Mörön |first=G. |date=2021-05-06 |title=ФОТО: УИХ дахь Ардчилсан намын бүлгийн гишүүд өлсгөлөн зарласан хоёр дахь өдөр |url=https://ikon.mn/n/27n8 |access-date=2025-09-09 |website=Ikon |language=mn}}</ref><ref name=":4" />

It was ultimately decided that Erdene would be nominated for the 2021 election.<ref name=":4" />

